From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: j7prime p3 <p3@j7prime.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: power: pd-samsung: add Exynos7870

The Exynos7870 power domains have the Exynos5433 register layout
(CONFIGURATION at +0, STATUS at +4, local power value 0xf; vendor
pmucal S5E7870: G3D 0x4000, DISPAUD 0x4020, ISP 0x4040, MFCMSCL 0x4060
from the PMU base).

Origin: Martin Štrobl, github.com/a3y17lte-mainline/kernel_samsung_exynos7870 (branch lineage-24.0) commit 6a473c8d6592.
---

Notes:
    Port to v7.3.4 + j7prime 0001-0017: applied unchanged.

 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/pd-samsung.yaml | 10 +++++++---
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/pd-samsung.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/pd-samsung.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/pd-samsung.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/pd-samsung.yaml
@@ -18,9 +18,13 @@
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    enum:
-      - samsung,exynos4210-pd
-      - samsung,exynos5433-pd
+    oneOf:
+      - enum:
+          - samsung,exynos4210-pd
+          - samsung,exynos5433-pd
+      - items:
+          - const: samsung,exynos7870-pd
+          - const: samsung,exynos5433-pd
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
-- 
